  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Asif vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 18 December, 2020 Bench: Anjani Kumar Mishra, Prakash Padia High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 9 Case :- Writ - C No. - 24102 of 2020 Petitioner :- Asif Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Jitendra Pal Singh Chauhan",
    "facts": "This writ petition has been filed seeking the following among other relief:- \"i) issue a writ, order or direction in nature of mandamus commanding/ directing the respondent nos. 2 and 3 District Magistrate, Muzaffarnagar & Designated Officer, Food Safety & Drug Administration, District Muzaffarnagar respectively for speedy disposal of claim of the petitioner regarding license for opening of meat shop under Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 pending since 26.6.2020 . \" It is stated that on the application of the petitioner for a licence to seen a meat shop, no objection certificate has been granted by the Gram Panchayat and SHO. Yet the license has not been issued to the petitioner for running the meat shop. In this regard, a representation dated 26.02.2020 has also Asif vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 18 December, 2020 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/102518583/ 1 been made, which is pending consideration.",
